   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of the\ncity of Yonkers",
    "basePrintNo": "S433",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S433-2025",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S433\n\nSPONSOR: STEWART-COUSINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of\nthe city of Yonkers\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThe purpose of this law is to extend the authorization for the city of\nYonkers to issue serial bonds and notes until June 30, 2026.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill amends existing law to extend authorization for\nthe City of Yonkers to issue serial bonds and notes through negotiated\nsale until June 30, 2026.\n\nSection 2 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill extends the marketing limitation on serial bonds/notes of\nYonkers from June 30, 2025 to June 30, 2026. The authorization for Yonk-\ners to negotiate the private sales of its bonds or notes is vital to\nimproving the city's financial stability and independence. The city's\nbonding authority will expire on June 30, 2025 unless it is extended.\nThe continuation of this power will allow more cost-effective financing\nfor the city of Yonkers.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2024 - S8899 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 131\n\n2023 - S400 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 168\n\n2022 - S8387 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 332\n\n2021 - S1033 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 168\n\n2020 - S7508B (Budget); Chapter 58, Part XXX, Subpart B, Item GG\n\n2019 - S3405 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 71\n\n2018 - S7352 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 81\n\n2017 - S6720 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 44\n\n2016 - S6355 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 45\n\n2015 - S3463 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 21\n\n2014 - S6313 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 70\n\n2013 - S3020 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 69\n\n2012 - S6460 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 72\n\n2011 - S2982 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 66\n\n2010 - S6720 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 125\n\n2009 - S3336 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 77\n\n2008 - S6878 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 144\n\n2007 - S4137 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 80\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
